resolve, write lock, materialize, prune

Usage: ambit install [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --frozen         fail if resolution would change ambit.lock
      --adopt          take ownership of existing unowned artifacts
      --copy           copy local-source skills instead of symlinking
      --link           symlink skills instead of copying
      --no-audit       skip scanning the bundle for hidden text
      --accept-exec    accept hooks and stdio MCP servers not in ambit.lock
      --dry-run        print the plan without touching disk
      --project <dir>  project directory
      --user           act on the user-level project in ~/.ambit
      --json           machine-readable output
      --offline        use only cached catalogs
  -h, --help           Print help
